    "No effect before saved removal; configuration/event veto, discarded receipt and repeated commit; exact same-ID source replacement and reentrant preparation.",
    "Committed custom/vanilla rewards, exact single-orb XP state, cue/particle/native shockwave invocation, known console coordinates/identity and actor-placeholder skipping.",
    "Caller/custom-event drop suppression applies to reward and experience effects while other configured effects remain eligible.",
